flowchart LR
    A[Quote Configuration Complete] --> B[Choose Configuration Step]
    B --> C[Configure Step Details]
    C --> D{Step Prerequisites Met?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Mark Step as Complete]
    E --> B
    D -- No --> C
    E -- All Steps Complete --> F[Save and Exit Wizard]
    F --> G[Policy Detail Page]
    G -- Activate Policy --> H[Policy Activated]